Z||000006||william_thorniii||01-18-2000||11:46 PM||||Al,<P>It sounds to me that it has to be one of your three external relay's.  Did you check all three?  One is located on each lamp assembly and a third is located on the fender.  If it works on one side and not the other, it has to be the relays or wiring.  I am not good at elecrical troubleshooting.  I will try to check out my Helms tonight and see if it has any useful information on this problem.<P>William T. Thorn, III ||||reg||3
Z||000008||AL||01-19-2000||10:22 PM||||william, all relays work, but this is what i found,in the drivers side connector, the grey one it has four wires going to it, on the right side that same connector only has three wires, does your fiero have this also or am i missing a wire?.i spliced some wires from the left side to the right and the motor worked, so it has to be the wire i'm missing or there is a short in the wires. but any way check your wires and tell me if yours are the same as mine, thanks bill, AL.||||reg||1
